+# Bug Fix: Authenticated customer shopping cart and order APIs
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Authenticated cart creation and mutation now associate carts with the authenticated customer and enforce ownership. Customer cart lookup, totals, checkout error handling, and customer order pagination now follow the requested authenticated behavior.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Routes authenticated POST/PUT cart operations through customer-aware ownership logic and rejects foreign cart mutations. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Optional cart-code retrieval now accepts only the authenticated customer's active cart. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartServiceImpl.java` | modified | Selects the most recently modified active customer cart. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderTotalApi.java` | modified | Preserves 404 ownership failures and stops converting them into 503 responses while calculating customer-address totals. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Enforces checkout cart ownership and maps calculated payment mismatches to 400 with the expected amount. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Supplies page/count using the repository's non-legacy pagination fields. |
+
+## Diff Highlights (optional)
+
+- Authenticated POST uses `addToCart(customer, ...)`; authenticated PUT claims an unowned cart or returns not found for another customer's cart.
+- Active-cart selection compares audit modification/creation timestamps, and checked-out carts remain excluded.
+- Authenticated checkout validates the cart customer before processing and preserves `ConversionException` as a 400 `ServiceRuntimeException`.
+- Customer order listing now sets `startPage` and `pageSize`, retaining repository ordering by descending order id and count/page metadata.
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No new automated tests were added; the existing cart and API integration suites were used for regression verification.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed after correcting two missing imports.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am test` → passed; 28 core tests with 13 skipped and 33 shop tests with 8 skipped, no failures.
+- Manual checks: reviewed the changed ownership, error mapping, checkout, and pagination paths; no live authenticated end-to-end fixture was available.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment suggested adding focused regression tests, but no tests were added because the repository has no fixtures covering authenticated customer cart ownership, tax totals, payment mismatch, or customer order pagination. The implementation remains within the assessed source paths.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add authenticated API integration fixtures for two customers, delivery tax, checkout payment mismatch, and order pagination metadata.
